end="00:28.430"><span begin="00:21.880" end="00:22.200">아닌</span><span begin="00:22.320" end="00:22.700"> 것만</span><span begin="00:22.810" end="00:24.020"> 같고</span><span begin="00:24.160" end="00:24.520"> 고갠</span><span begin="00:24.920" end="00:25.770"> 떨궈지는</span><span begin="00:25.770" end="00:27.270"> 날</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.430" end="00:33.720"><span begin="00:28.430" end="00:28.810">그럴</span><span begin="00:28.970" end="00:29.670"> 때마다</span><span begin="00:29.980" end="00:30.830"> 내게</span><span begin="00:30.980" end="00:31.630"> 얼마나</span><span begin="00:31.810" end="00:32.660"> 내가</span><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.720"> 소중한지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.720" end="00:38.140"><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:35.490">말해주는</span><span begin="00:35.710" end="00:36.100"> 너의</span><span begin="00:36.240" end="00:36.400"> 그</span><span begin="00:36.480" end="00:37.980"> 한마디에</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.140" end="00:42.200"><span begin="00:38.140" end="00:38.600">Everything's</span><span begin="00:38.660" end="00:40.050"> alright,</span><span begin="00:40.100" end="00:40.390"> 초라한</span><span begin="00:40.480" end="00:41.980"> nobody에서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.200" end="00:45.680"><span begin="00:42.200" end="00:42.280">다시</span><span begin="00:42.310" end="00:43.340"> somebody,</span><span begin="00:43.420" end="00:44.050"> 특별한</span><span begin="00:44.130" end="00:44.390"> 나로</span><span begin="00:44.480" end="00:45.680"> 변해</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.680" end="00:48.370"><span begin="00:45.680" end="00:45.850">You</span><span begin="00:45.900" end="00:46.040"> make</span><span begin="00:46.090" end="00:46.190"> me</span><span begin="00:46.250" end="00:46.510"> feel</span><span begin="00:46.600" end="00:48.100"> special</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.370" end="00:52.120"><span begin="00:48.370" end="00:48.890">세상이</span><span begin="00:49.020" end="00:49.300"> 아무리</span><spa