550">날</span><span begin="01:10.590" end="01:10.960"> 부르는</span><span begin="01:11.130" end="01:11.410"> 네</span><span begin="01:11.490" end="01:12.260"> 목소리에</span><span begin="01:12.360" end="01:13.140"> (소리에),</span><span begin="01:13.240" end="01:13.330"> I</span><span begin="01:13.520" end="01:14.000"> feel</span><span begin="01:14.090" end="01:14.680"> loved,</span><span begin="01:14.950" end="01:15.610"> I</span><span begin="01:15.680" end="01:16.230"> feel</span><span begin="01:16.380" end="01:16.570"> so</span><span begin="01:16.650" end="01:18.150"> special</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.930" end="01:22.570"><span begin="01:18.930" end="01:20.090">자꾸</span><span begin="01:20.270" end="01:20.750"> 숨고만</span><span begin="01:20.830" end="01:22.330"> 싶어서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.570" end="01:25.150"><span begin="01:22.570" end="01:22.980">마주</span><span begin="01:23.680" end="01:24.350"> 하기가</span><span begin="01:24.490" end="01:25.150"> 싫어서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.150" end="01:27.520"><span begin="01:25.150" end="01:25.510">모든</span><span begin="01:25.640" end="01:25.870"> 게</span><span begin="01:26.000" end="01:26.370"> 의미를</span><span begin="01:26.470" end="01:26.710"> 잃은</span><span begin="01:26.730" end="01:27.520"> 듯이</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.520" end="01:34.120"><span begin="01:27.520" end="01:27.600">내가</span><span begin="01:27.680" end="01:28.150"> 의미를</span><span begin="01:28.260" end="01:28.480"> 잃은</span><span begin="01:28.530" end="01:28.780"> 듯이</span><span begin="01:28.890" end="01:29.380"> 가만히</span><span begin="01:30.470" end="01:31.100"> 주저앉아</span><span begin="01:31.330" end="01:31.830"> 있을</span><span begin="01:32.130" end="01:32.340"> 때</span><span begin="01:32.490" end="01:33.990"> (oh)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.120" end="01:37.980"><span begin="01:34.120" end="01:34.500">그때</span><span begin="01:34.640" end="01:34.950"> 내</span><span begin="01:35.100" end="01:35.60