.820"><span begin="01:58.890" end="01:59.010">네가</span><span begin="01:59.060" end="01:59.400"> 있어</span><span begin="01:59.630" end="01:59.790"> 난</span><span begin="01:59.930" end="02:00.360"> 다시</span><span begin="02:00.550" end="02:00.740"> 웃어</span><span begin="02:00.810" end="02:01.140"> (다시</span><span begin="02:01.190" end="02:01.650"> 웃어),</span><span begin="02:01.760" end="02:02.210"> that's</span><span begin="02:02.290" end="02:02.520"> what</span><span begin="02:02.600" end="02:02.640"> you</span><span begin="02:02.640" end="02:03.820"> do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.820" end="02:06.680"><span begin="02:03.820" end="02:04.210">Again,</span><span begin="02:04.290" end="02:04.340"> I</span><span begin="02:04.410" end="02:04.660"> feel</span><span begin="02:04.760" end="02:06.260"> special</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.680" end="02:10.180"><span begin="02:06.680" end="02:07.270">아무것도</span><span begin="02:07.400" end="02:07.710"> 아닌</span><span begin="02:07.910" end="02:08.310"> 존재</span><span begin="02:08.540" end="02:09.320"> 같다가도</span><span begin="02:09.510" end="02:10.180"> (같다가도)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.180" end="02:13.760"><span begin="02:10.180" end="02:11.030">사라져도</span><span begin="02:11.230" end="02:11.630"> 모를</span><span begin="02:11.780" end="02:12.070"> 사람</span><span begin="02:12.170" end="02:13.670"> 같다가도</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.760" end="02:21.130"><span begin="02:13.760" end="02:13.790">날</span><span begin="02:13.820" end="02:13.960"> 부르는</span><span begin="02:14.300" end="02:14.650"> 네</span><span begin="02:14.740" end="02:15.060"> 목소리에</span><span begin="02:15.150" end="02:16.360"> (소리에),</span><span begin="02:16.420" end="02:16.460"> I</span><span begin="02:16.650" end="02:16.860"> feel</span><span begin="02:16.900" end="02:17.080"> loved,</span><span begin="02:17.660" end="02:18.420"> I</span><span begin="02:18.470" end="02:19.120"> feel</span><span begin="02:19.240" end="02:1